    <sectiondef kind="user-defined">
      <header>Deprecated Value Wrappers</header>
      <description><para>The v5.0.1 names of the <computeroutput>to_*</computeroutput> value wrappers.</para>
<para>The Boost UT style names, with a leading underscore, kept for compatibility with the existing applications. Each one is an alias of the corresponding <computeroutput>to_*</computeroutput> wrapper, so the wrapped values are compared and reported in the same way. They do not conflict with the literal operators with the same suffixes (<computeroutput>42<ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-deprecated-literals_1ga8468610e763177a8f569f7d618851288" kindref="member">_i</ref></computeroutput>), which are in the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1literals" kindref="compound">literals</ref></computeroutput> namespace.</para>
<para>GCC reports the deprecation only when the alias names the type of a declaration, not when it is used in an expression, as in <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-deprecated-literals_1ga8468610e763177a8f569f7d618851288" kindref="member">_i</ref> (expr)</computeroutput>; Clang reports it in both cases.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Deprecated</title><para>Pass the plain values to the function comparators <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-function-comparators_1ga0fbc0f7ddf0107c1e5265bb79287487d" kindref="member">eq()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-function-comparators_1ga92cdc2dde6af040f2f5f5df677df0985" kindref="member">ne()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-function-comparators_1ga90da2cbc14b4562332a205d5b232356f" kindref="member">gt()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-function-comparators_1ga58c7dacabca3fe1b0dc025a0e0f30e9e" kindref="member">ge()</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-function-comparators_1ga493a42c738ef38b45a28b06a2155aa00" kindref="member">lt()</ref></computeroutput>, and <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-function-comparators_1ga9125d2dd997269eecc0d8239d5df67e5" kindref="member">le()</ref></computeroutput> instead; the <computeroutput>to_*</computeroutput> value wrappers that replaced these aliases (since 3.2.0) are deprecated too (since 6.0.0). </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</description>
